---
title: Credit Passport SBT Lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> NOT_ISSUED
  NOT_ISSUED --> ACTIVE : KYC verified + mint SBT
  ACTIVE --> UPGRADED : full installment repayment
  ACTIVE --> DOWNGRADED : default — never revoked
  DOWNGRADED --> ACTIVE : cure — tier retained
  UPGRADED --> ACTIVE : maintenance / new cycle

  note right of ACTIVE
    Non-transferable SBT
    ICreditPassport.getScore wallet
    read-only for GroupPool,
    peer Local Banks, external protocols
  end note
